OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies welcome right to
OL,4,Achallenge A&E care
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies with experience of loved ones
OL,7,Freceiving critical care have welcomed
OL,8,Fthe expansion of a new right to request
OL,9,Fa rapid review in A&E.
OL,11,FNamed after 13-year-old Martha Mills,
OL,12,Fwho died from sepsis in 2021, Martha's
OL,13,FRule allows patients, loved ones and
OL,14,Fstaff to request an urgent review if
OL,15,Fthey believe a patient is deteriorating
OL,16,Fand their concerns are not being heard.
OL,18,FThe scheme is already being being
OL,19,Fpiloted in A&Es in Gloucester,
OL,20,FCheltenham, Taunton and Yeovil and is
OL,21,Fset to be rolled out in all emergency
OL,22,Fdepartments in England by March 2028.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
